      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/sybertsville_pennsylvania",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Sybertsville lies just one mile northwest of Conyngham and six miles west-northwest of Hazleton, linking it to regional hubs.",
